   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">An Afghan national Army soldier with 3rd Tolai, 3rd Kandak, 215th Corps challenges a Marine with Fox Company, 2nd Battalion, 9th Marine Regiment for possession of the ball during a soccer match in Marjah, March 23, 2012. The Marines and soldiers regularly play soccer together to build camaraderie between the forces.</rdf:li>
